Lesson 032: Source-Mask Optimization — Why the Illumination and Reticle Pattern Are Designed Together

We will move from correcting the mask alone to jointly optimizing the scanner illumination and mask pattern, and see why lithography performance increasingly comes from co-designing the entire imaging system.`,
} satisfies Lesson;
